WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
Hey guys,
You know, I'm on my way to the gym.&nbsp;

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.180
And I realized that I haven't&nbsp;
been to the gym in almost a month.&nbsp;

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:11.280
That's just how busy we are here at DLM.
My team and I are working crazy early&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.100
mornings - late nights - and trying to get videos&nbsp;
out there to share the gospel on Men's Lifestyle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.360
and Christian Lifestyle every week.
And it's been difficult.&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.240
We have load shedding here in South Africa.
Scheduled power outages, which makes things worse.&nbsp;

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:35.760
And thank you Liz and Ross from our DLM&nbsp;
family for buying for us a generator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:40.680
for me and for Danie and Jaques, the &nbsp;
team manager and the head video editor.&nbsp;

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:47.280
They bought them inverters, which is amazing, so&nbsp;
the three of us can power through power outages.&nbsp;

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:53.820
But I want to ask you guys to please continue&nbsp;
to pray for us and support us as a team.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:56.880
I love you guys and thank you.

